{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15220180","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15220180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1522018001:0":{"text":"残念ながら、あなたが釣り上げたのは普通の魚だけだった。","source_cn":"很遗憾，你钓上来的只是一条普通的鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6D23E938824750","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522018002:1":{"text":"もしかしたら、本当に蜜露を塗った方がいいかもとも思ったが、それでもあなたは自分を信じる。","source_cn":"听刚才那些人的描述，金鳞蛇皇恐怕不会轻易上钩。你甚至开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897A3E8274A6E16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522018003:1":{"text":"これまでに何度も沼で竿を振ってきたのだから。","source_cn":"不过你依旧相信自己，毕竟你曾在沼泽边甩过无数次钓竿。钓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x745797CE3FA802BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522018004:0":{"text":"その経験から、次の一投できっと驚きの結果が待っていると、あなたは予感する。","source_cn":"再试一下吧。以你的经验，下一竿总会有惊喜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF5FE01539B9DC18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1522018005:0":{"text":"あなたは再び竿を振り、ただ静かにそのときを待つ……","source_cn":"你再次抛竿，耐心等待了一会儿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E113A60848FEF95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","doc